      "content": "Query and visualize datasets stored on the Hugging Face Hub through a lightweight REST API. Get dataset splits, preview rows, search and filter data, access Parquet files, retrieve size statistics, and obtain Croissant metadata - all without downloading the entire dataset.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Hugging Face Support",
